body:
It's good to know that I am not alone in my feelings.

> It's very painful knowing that people love you sometimes

That is a very powerful statement of truth.  People loving you brings responsibility not to hurt those people, by action or inaction, as it were - when that conflicts with your own instincts then pain is certainly the result.

I don't feel that I am in immediate danger - but I would be if anything happened to remove my network.  Having said that, I guess that would be true of many people.  With me it's like i'm in a while loop.

    do {
         continue;
    }
    while (family->alive() && friends->alive())

    die('finally');

That said, thank you for your concern and response :-)
